mode reach codex pi dsh and harness argv and is the opencode workspace write default with compensating enforcement sound\"}\n{\"nodeId\":\"F-1-004\",\"parentId\":\"root\",\"depth\":1,\"scope\":\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/mode-append-gateway/append-mode-event.ts .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/legacy-projections/deep-review-state-contract.ts\",\"question\":\"Gateway identity: does the append gateway mint event id, idempotency key, producer and epoch for model-written review and research rows, and refuse a reused key with different content instead of replaying the old receipt?\",\"status\":\"open\",\"reason\":null,\"iteration\":0,\"dedupeKey\":\"gateway identity does the append gateway mint event id idempotency key producer and epoch for model written review and research rows and refuse a reused key with different content instead of replaying the old receipt\"}\n{\"nodeId\":\"F-1-006\",\"parentId\":\"root\",\"depth\":1,\"scope\":\".skilled/commands/deep .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/feature-catalog\",\"question\":\"Docs and contracts: do the command docs, compiled contracts, references, feature catalogs and playbooks describe what the round 5 and 6 code now does?\",\"status\":\"open\",\"reason\":null,\"iteration\":0,\"dedupeKey\":\"docs and contracts do the command docs compiled contracts references feature catalogs and playbooks describe what the round 5 and 6 code now does\"}\n--- invocation-metadata ---\n{\"effectiveConfig\":{\"kind\":\"cli-opencode\",\"executable\":\"opencode\",\"executableVersion\":\"sha256:635c523002b6eaf897597facba703729794cb07bdb59044d5e173b07b77ff934\",\"model\":\"llmgateway/deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017\",\"reasoningEffort\":\"max\",\"serviceTier\":null,\"sandboxMode\":\"workspace-write\",\"permissionMode\":null,\"sandboxEnforcement\":\"compensating\",\"effortApplied\":\"flag\",\"webSearch\":\"inherit\"},\"invocationFingerprint\":\"inv:165a1bed12a1feeeee64bf6e2b7d1454ad6869fb4fdc44cc42e82670632cf48e\"}\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"ls -la specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek/ && echo \\\"--- frontier-nodes ---\\\" && cat specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek/frontier-nodes.jsonl && echo \\\"--- invocation-metadata ---\\\" && cat specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek/invocation-metadata.json\"}"},"time":{"start":1795201554969,"end":1795201555298}}}}
