el must be on the enforced allowlist. `reasoningEffort` maps to `--thinking`. No `--service-tier`, no sandbox flag.\n=== compiled ===\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/compiled/deep-review.contract.markdown:371:     G) cli-pi — requires `pi`. Model must be on the enforced allowlist. `reasoningEffort` maps to `--thinking`. No `--service-tier`, no sandbox flag.\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/compiled/deep-research.contract.markdown:350:     G) cli-pi — requires `pi`. Model must be on the enforced allowlist. `reasoningEffort` maps to `--thinking`. No `--service-tier`, no sandbox flag.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"grep -n \\\"cli-pi —\\\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-presentation.txt .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-presentation.txt; echo \\\"=== compiled ===\\\"; grep -n \\\"cli-pi —\\\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/compiled/deep-review.contract.markdown .skilled/commands/deep/assets/compiled/deep-research.contract.markdown | head -4\"}"},"time":{"start":1795202432692,"end":1795202433054}}}}
