ms ===\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/command-flow-stress-tests/resource-map-coverage-gate.md:11:> **SANDBOXED SCENARIO**: All artifacts live under `/tmp/cp-054-sandbox/` and `/tmp/cp-054-spec/`.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/command-flow-stress-tests/resource-map-coverage-gate.md:31:- Expected execution process: create sandbox and spec fixture, add `resource-map.md` plus `/tmp/cp-054-spec/applied/T-001.md`, run one traceability iteration, then inspect artifacts.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/command-flow-stress-tests/resource-map-coverage-gate.md:42:1. Prepare the sandbox and external spec root.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/command-flow-stress-tests/resource-map-coverage-gate.md:53:rm -rf /tmp/cp-054-sandbox /tmp/cp-054-sandbox-baseline /tmp/cp-054-spec\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/command-flow-stress-tests/resource-map-coverage-gate.md:55:.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/command-flow-stress-tests/setup-cp-sandbox.sh --sandbox-dir /tmp/cp-054-sandbox\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/command-flow-stress-tests/resource-map-coverage-gate.md:61:| `/tmp/cp-054-sandbox/targets/review-target.js` | Target file for traceability coverage |\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/command-flow-stress-tests/resource-map-coverage-gate.md:67:- /tmp/cp-054-sandbox/targets/review-target.js\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/command-flow-stress-tests/resource-map-coverage-gate.md:69:cp -a /tmp/cp-054-sandbox /tmp/cp-054-sandbox-baseline\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/command-flow-stress-tests/resource-map-coverage-gate.md:71:git status --porcelain -- /tmp/cp-054-sandbox /tmp/cp-054-spec > /tmp/cp-054-pre.txt\n.s