{"type":"text","timestamp":1795203015493,"sessionID":"<redacted>","part":{"id":"prt_1fa701e94002hA7WCo0mpKPkJV","sessionID":"<redacted>","messageID":"msg_1fa701324001DYzSaECX3P36kG","type":"text","text":"The lineage is complete. All 16 iterations ran inline, every state record went through the append gateway, and the reducer refreshed the registry, dashboard and strategy after each pass.\n\n## Review Iteration Summary\n\n- **Iterations**: 16 of 24, stop reason `all_dimensions_clean`, frontier drained 4/4 nodes answered\n- **Findings**: 0 P0, 0 P1, 9 P2 (advisories)\n- **Verdict**: PASS with `hasAdvisories: true`\n- **Dimensions**: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability all covered on all four frontier nodes (F-1-002, F-1-004, F-1-006, F-2-007)\n- **Terminal gates**: evidence, scope and coverage all `pass`; no failed required gate\n- **Traceability**: `spec_code` pass, `checklist_evidence` notApplicable, `feature_catalog_code` partial, `playbook_capability` pass, `skill_agent`/`agent_cross_runtime` notApplicable\n\nThe nine P2s cluster into four workstreams: sandbox provenance (dsh narrowing vs recorded mode, devin's runner-level guard missing from the label), gateway identity (the strip covers four fields but not the four `buildPreparedInput` also reads; the projection keeps what the envelope drops), executor docs (pi's stale \"no sandbox flag\" line in four files, the overstated drift-detection claim, the stale `auto-approve-flag` doc, unguarded duplication), and the `frontierNodeId` schema omission.\n\n## Files Written\n\n`deep-review-config.json`, `deep-review-state.jsonl` (gateway-owned), `deep-review-findings-registry.json`, `deep-review-strategy.md`, `deep-review-dashboard.md`, `review-report.md`, `resource-map.md`, `frontier-known-texts.json`, 16 `iterations/iteration-NNN.md`, 16 `deltas/iter-NNN.jsonl` plus their record files, and the gateway ledger/audit/effect stores — all inside `specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/deepseek`.\n\n## Deviations Recorded\n\n- One shell redirect wrote `/tmp/gw2.json` while capturing a gateway receipt (iteration 2). That is outside the lineage write surface. No repo file was touched; `git status` shows no change under `.skilled/` and none outside the lineage and the parent's own review packet.\n- `validate.sh` was not run, per the dispatcher's explicit prohibition. Verification instead used `verify-iteration.cjs` (exit 0 for iteration 16), the terminal-gate script, `review-verdict.cjs`, and a consistency check over all 16 iteration files and deltas.\n- Iterations 1–2 reported `newFindingsRatio` on an iteration-local denominator; from iteration 3 the accumulated denominator is used and the correction is recorded in iteration 3's edge cases.\n\nFANOUT_LINEAGE_COMPLETE:deepseek","time":{"start":1795203014293,"end":1795203015493}}}
